# smolclaw default config — the Kconfig default-y feature set
# This file is intentionally empty: it accepts Kconfig defaults. That enables
# the "default y" features only. The "default n" features (X, X_TOOLS, GITEA,
# CAMERA, VOICE, CODE_GRAPH, OUTPUT_FILTER, ANALYTICS, DELEGATE, MOA,
# STRICT_SECURITY) stay OFF — enable them with menuconfig or -DSC_ENABLE_*=ON.
# NOTE: this is NOT "all features"; ctest on this profile is 39 tests, 43 with
# X + OUTPUT_FILTER + ANALYTICS + DELEGATE additionally enabled.
# Copy to .config and run cmake to use.
